    "title": "Custom PC Builds, Upgrades & Care | QuiviTech Malaysia",
    "description": "QuiviTech Malaysia offers custom PC builds, upgrades, diagnostics and long-term PC care. Harga Telus, Kualiti Memang Premium.",
    "html": "<main class=\"site-main editorial-home\" id=\"main\">\n<section class=\"home-hero\"><video class=\"hero-video\" src=\"./frostbyte-showcase.mp4\" poster=\"./pc-showcase.jpg\" muted loop playsinline preload=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></video><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"hero-center\"><h1 class=\"headline\">Your Dream PC.<br/><span>Made Real.</span></h1><p>Custom PCs built around your life. Transparent pricing, premium craftsmanship and support beyond the build.</p></div><div class=\"hero-meta\"><span>QUIVITECH / BESPOKE PC EXPERIENCE</span><span>DESIGNED FOR YOU · MALAYSIA</span></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"one-journey section\"><div class=\"container journey-intro\" data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"journey-mascot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img class=\"journey-image journey-image-first\" src=\"./journey-first.svg\" alt=\"\"/><img class=\"journey-image journey-image-second\" src=\"./journey-second.svg\" alt=\"\"/></div><div><span class=\"kicker\">01 / THE QUIVITECH WAY</span><h2 class=\"headline h2\" aria-label=\"One journey, one ecosystem, one build\">ONE <span class=\"type-accent journey-words\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"journey-word-width\">Ecosystem</span><span class=\"journey-word\">Journey</span></span></h2><div class=\"journey-statement\"><p><span>Some</span> <span>journeys</span> <span>deserve</span> <span>more</span> <span>than</span> <span>a</span> <span>single</span> <span>moment.</span> <span>They</span> <span>deserve</span> <span>an</span> <span>experience</span> <span>that</span> <span>stays</span> <span>with</span> <span>you.</span></p></div></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"ecosystem\" class=\"home-ecosystem section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"editorial-heading\" data-reveal=\"\"><span class=\"kicker\">02 / BUILT AROUND YOU</span><h2 class=\"headline h2\">ECOSYSTEM<span class=\"dot-accent\">.</span></h2><p>Everything your PC needs. Nothing it doesn't.</p></div></div><div class=\"eco-viewport\"><div class=\"eco-grid\"><a class=\"eco-card eco-build\" href=\"/quivicraft\"><div class=\"eco-photo\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/ecosystem-craft.svg\"/></div><div class=\"eco-copy\"><span>01 / CUSTOM PC</span><h3>QuiviCraft.</h3><p class=\"eco-description\"><span class=\"eco-description-default\">Precision builds, your way.</span><span class=\"eco-description-detail\">Designed for you. Tested in our Studio. Built in your home.</span></p><b>Lets Get Building <span data-icon=\"ArrowUpRight\"></span></b></div></a><a class=\"eco-card eco-plus\" href=\"/quiviplus\"><div class=\"eco-photo\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/ecosystem-plus.svg\"/></div><div class=\"eco-copy\"><span>02 / TECH SUPPORT</span><h3>QuiviPlus.</h3><p class=\"eco-description\"><span class=\"eco-description-default\">Upgrade, refresh, repeat.</span><span class=\"eco-description-detail\">Routine care when you need it. Expert help when it matters. Tailored to your membership.</span></p><b>Peace Of Mind Awaits <span data-icon=\"ArrowUpRight\"></span></b></div></a><a class=\"eco-card eco-merch\" href=\"/quivimerch\"><div class=\"eco-photo\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/ecosystem-merch.svg\"/></div><div class=\"eco-copy\"><span>03 / MERCH</span><h3>QuiviMerch.</h3><p class=\"eco-description\"><span class=\"eco-description-default\">For Quivies.</span><span class=\"eco-description-detail\">Signature pieces for the Quivies</span></p><b>Explore the collection <span data-icon=\"ArrowUpRight\"></span></b></div></a></div></div></section>\n<section id=\"experience\" class=\"experience section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"experience-stage\"><div class=\"editorial-heading centered\" data-reveal=\"\"><span class=\"kicker\">03 / THE QUIVICRAFT EXPERIENCE</span><h2 class=\"headline h2\">THE EXPERIENCE<span class=\"dot-accent\">.</span></h2><p>One build. Four ways we make it better.</p></div><div class=\"experience-stack\"><article class=\"experience-card craft-panel\"><div class=\"experience-copy\"><span>ACT 1</span><h3 class=\"headline\">The Dream</h3><p>Every great story begins with an idea waiting to become reality.</p></div><div class=\"experience-art\"><img class=\"experience-act-image\" alt=\"\" src=\"/act1.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></article><article class=\"experience-card serve-panel\"><div class=\"experience-copy\"><span>ACT II</span><h3 class=\"headline\">The Set-up</h3><p>Long before build day arrives, every component is carefully inspected, tested, and prepared in our Studio—so your dream is ready when the moment arrives.</p></div><div class=\"experience-art\"><img class=\"experience-act-image\" alt=\"\" src=\"/act2.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></article><article class=\"experience-card care-panel\"><div class=\"experience-copy\"><span>ACT III</span><h3 class=\"headline\">The Moment.</h3><p>The moment your dream becomes reality, built right before your eyes.</p></div><div class=\"experience-art\"><img class=\"experience-act-image\" alt=\"\" src=\"/act3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></article><article class=\"experience-card thread-panel\"><div class=\"experience-copy\"><span>ENCORE</span><h3 class=\"headline\">Beyond The Build</h3><p>The final component may be installed, but your story with QuiviTech is only beginning.</p></div><div class=\"experience-art\"><img class=\"experience-act-image\" alt=\"\" src=\"/act4.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></article></div></div></div></section>\n<div class=\"experience-end\"><div class=\"experience-marquee\" data-parallax=\"\"><div class=\"marquee-group\"><div class=\"marquee-pill\"><p>The final component may be installed</p><img class=\"marquee-icon\" src=\"./journey-first.svg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"/></div><div class=\"marquee-pill\"><p>but your story with QuiviTech is only beginning.</p><img class=\"marquee-icon\" src=\"./journey-second.svg\" alt=\"\" 