rc=\"./journey-first.svg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"/></div><div class=\"marquee-pill\"><p>but your story with QuiviTech is only beginning.</p><img class=\"marquee-icon\" src=\"./journey-second.svg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"/></div><div class=\"marquee-pill\"><p>So... When will yours begin?</p><img class=\"marquee-icon\" src=\"./journey-first.svg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"/></div><div class=\"marquee-pill\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><p>The final component may be installed</p><img class=\"marquee-icon\" src=\"./journey-second.svg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"/></div><div class=\"marquee-pill\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><p>but your story with QuiviTech is only beginning.</p><img class=\"marquee-icon\" src=\"./journey-first.svg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"/></div><div class=\"marquee-pill\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><p>So... When will yours begin?</p><img class=\"marquee-icon\" src=\"./journey-second.svg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"/></div><div class=\"marquee-pill\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><p>The final component may be installed</p><img class=\"marquee-icon\" src=\"./journey-first.svg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"/></div><div class=\"marquee-pill\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><p>but your story with QuiviTech is only beginning.</p><img class=\"marquee-icon\" src=\"./journey-second.svg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"/></div><div class=\"marquee-pill\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><p>So... When will yours begin?</p><img class=\"marquee-icon\" src=\"./journey-first.svg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"/></div><div class=\"marquee-pill\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><p>The final component may be installed</p><img class=\"marquee-icon\" src=\"./journey-second.svg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"/></div><div class=\"marquee-pill\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><p>but your story with QuiviTech is only beginning.</p><img class=\"marquee-icon\" src=\"./journey-first.svg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"/></div><div class=\"marquee-pill\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><p>So... When will yours begin?</p><img class=\"marquee-icon\" src=\"./j