  "/quivicraft": {
    "name": "QuiviCraft",
    "title": "QuiviCraft Custom PC Ecosystem | QuiviTech Malaysia",
    "description": "Explore QuiviCraft custom PC building in Malaysia, including component selection, QuiviServe membership, QuiviCare warranty and QuiviThread cables.",
    "html": "<main class=\"site-main quivicraft-overview\" id=\"main\">\n<section class=\"page-hero\"><div class=\"container\"><span class=\"kicker\">QUIVICRAFT</span><h1 class=\"headline h1\">Your PC. Built around what you do.</h1><p>From gaming to creative work, QuiviCraft helps you choose a build that fits how you use it and what you want to spend.</p><a class=\"hero-scroll-arrow\" href=\"#page-content\" aria-label=\"Scroll to the next section\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></a></div></section>\n<section id=\"page-content\" class=\"section craft-bridge\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-head\" data-reveal=\"\"><h2 class=\"headline h2\">What makes a PC right for you?</h2></div><div class=\"craft-guide\" data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"craft-guide-topics\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"PC characteristics\" aria-orientation=\"vertical\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"guide-performance\" role=\"tab\" aria-controls=\"panel-performance\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"craft-guide-icon\"><span data-icon=\"Cpu\"></span></span><span>Performance</span></button><button type=\"button\" id=\"guide-cooling\" role=\"tab\" aria-controls=\"panel-cooling\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"craft-guide-icon\"><span data-icon=\"Wind\"></span></span><span>Cooling</span></button><button type=\"button\" id=\"guide-upgrades\" role=\"tab\" aria-controls=\"panel-upgrades\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"craft-guide-icon\"><span data-icon=\"Expand\"></span></span><span>Room to upgrade</span></button></div><div class=\"craft-guide-detail\"><div id=\"panel-performance\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"guide-performance\"><img src=\"/craft-guide-performance.jpg\" alt=\"Gaming PC interior with a GeForce RTX graphics card\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/><div class=\"craft-guide-overlay\"><p>Choose parts around the games, apps, and workloads you use most.</p><a class=\"craft-guide-action\" href=\"/quivicraft/details\">Explore QuiviCraft <span data-icon=\"ArrowUpRight\"></span></a></div></div><div id=\"panel-cooling\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"guide-cooling\" hidden=\"\"><img src=\"/craft-guide-cooling.jpg\" alt=\"Close-up of a desktop PC cooling fan\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/><div class=\"craft-guide-overlay\"><p>Give your components the airflow and cooling they need for long sessions.</p><a class=\"craft-guide-action\" href=\"/quivicraft/details\">Explore QuiviCraft <span data-icon=\"ArrowUpRight\"></span></a></div></div><div id=\"panel-upgrades\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"guide-upgrades\" hidden=\"\"><img src=\"/craft-guide-upgrades.jpg\" alt=\"Technician connecting components inside an open desktop PC\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/><div class=\"craft-guide-overlay\"><p>Leave space for more storage, memory, or a future graphics card as your needs change.</p><a class=\"craft-guide-action\" href=\"/quivicraft/details\">Explore QuiviCraft <span data-icon=\"ArrowUpRight\"></span></a></div></div></div></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"section craft-services\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-head\" data-reveal=\"\"><h2 class=\"headline h2\">From the final touches to long-term care</h2><p>Personalise your PC, keep it maintained, and know where to turn if a component fails.</p></div><div class=\"craft-overview-grid\" data-stagger=\"\">\n<article class=\"craft-flip thread-panel\"><div class=\"craft-flip-inner\"><div class=\"craft-flip-face craft-flip-front\"><div class=\"craft-flip-copy\"><span class=\"craft-flip-label\">CUSTOM CABLES</span><h3>QuiviThread</h3><p>Cable management and custom cables.</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"craft-flip-toggle\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Show QuiviThread details\" aria-controls=\"craft-thread-back\"></button></div></div><div class=\"craft-flip-face craft-flip-back\" id=\"craft-thread-back\" inert=\"\"><h3>QuiviThread</h3><p>Keep the wiring tidy with cable management, or choose custom cables to match the look of your setup.</p><div class=\"craft-flip-actions\"><a class=\"craft-guide-action\" href=\"/quivicraft/thread\"><span class=\"craft-flip-link-label\">Explore QuiviThread <span data-icon=\"ArrowUpRight\"></span></span></a><button type=\"button\" class=\"craft-flip-toggle\" aria-label=\"Show QuiviThread summary\"></button></div></div></div><img class=\"craft-flip-art\" src=\"/quivi-thread.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"/></article>\n<article class=\"craft-flip serve-panel\"><div class=\"craft-flip-inner\"><div class=\"craft-flip-face craft-flip-front\"><div class=\"craft-flip-copy\"><span class=\"craft-flip-label\">MAINTENANCE</span><h3>QuiviServe</h3><p>Maintenance for your PC components.</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"craft-flip-toggle\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Show QuiviServe details\" aria-controls=\"craft-serve-back\"></button></div></div><div class=\"craft-flip-face craft-flip-back\" id=\"craft-serve-back\" inert=\"\"><h3>QuiviServe</h3><p>Get help maintaining your PC components after handover, with care options based on your membership.</p><div class=\"craft-flip-actions\"><a class=\"craft-guide-action\" href=\"/quivicraft/serve\"><span class=\"craft-flip-link-label\">Explore QuiviServe <span data-icon=\"ArrowUpRight\"></span></span></a><button type=\"button\" class=\"craft-flip-toggle\" aria-label=\"Show QuiviServe summary\"></button></div></div></div><img class=\"craft-flip-art\" src=\"/quivi-serve.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"/></article>\n<article class=\"craft-flip care-panel\"><div class=\"craft-flip-inner\"><div class=\"craft-flip-face craft-flip-front\"><div class=\"craft-flip-copy\"><span class=\"craft-flip-label\">WARRANTY</span><h3>QuiviCare</h3><p>Warranty support for PC components.</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"craft-flip-toggle\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Show QuiviCare details\" aria-controls=\"craft-care-back\"></button></div></div><div class=\"craft-flip-face craft-flip-back\" id=\"craft-care-back\" inert=\"\"><h3>QuiviCare</h3><p>Check which components are covered under warranty and how to get help if something fails.</p><div class=\"craft-flip-actions\"><a class=\"craft-guide-action\" href=\"/quivicraft/care\"><span class=\"craft-flip-link-label\">Explore QuiviCare <span data-icon=\"ArrowUpRight\"></span></span></a><button type=\"button\" class=\"craft-flip-toggle\" aria-label=\"Show QuiviCare summary\"></button></div></div></div><img class=\"craft-flip-art\" src=\"/quivi-care.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"/></article>\r\n</div></div></section><aside class=\"experience-end craft-kit-marquee\" aria-label=\"QuiviTech Essential Kit offer\"><div class=\"experience-marquee\"><div class=\"marquee-group\"><div class=\"marquee-pill\"><p>One complimentary QuiviTech Essential Kit with builds below RM10,000.</p><img class=\"marquee-icon\" src=\"/quivi-essential-kit.svg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"/></div><div class=\"marquee-pill\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><p>One complimentary QuiviTech Essential Kit with builds below RM10,000.</p><img class=\"marquee-icon\" src=\"/quivi-essential-kit.svg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"/></div><div class=\"marquee-pill\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><p>One complimentary QuiviTech Essential Kit with builds below RM10,000.</p><img class=\"marquee-icon\" src=\"/quivi-essential-kit.svg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"/></div><div class=\"marquee-pill\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><p>One complimentary QuiviTech Essential Kit with builds below RM10,000.</p><img class=\"marquee-icon\" src=\"/quivi-essential-kit.svg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"/></div><div class=\"marquee-pill\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><p>One complimentary QuiviTech Essential Kit with builds below RM10,000.</p><img class=\"marquee-icon\" src=\"/quivi-essential-kit.svg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"/></div><div class=\"marquee-pill\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><p>One complimentary QuiviTech Essential Kit with builds below RM10,000.</p><img class=\"marquee-icon\" src=\"/quivi-essential-kit.svg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"/></div></div><div class=\"marquee-group\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"marquee-pill\"><p>One complimentary QuiviTech Essential Kit with builds below RM10,000.</p><img class=\"marquee-icon\" src=\"/quivi-essential-kit.svg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"/></div><div class=\"marquee-pill\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><p>One complimentary QuiviTech Essential Kit with builds below RM10,000.</p><img class=\"marquee-icon\" src=\"/quivi-essential-kit.svg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"/></div><div class=\"marquee-pill\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><p>One complimentary QuiviTech Essential Kit with builds below RM10,000.</p><img class=\"marquee-icon\" src=\"/quivi-essential-kit.svg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"/></div><div class=\"marquee-pill\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><p>One complimentary QuiviTech Essential Kit with builds below RM10,000.</p><img class=\"marquee-icon\" src=\"/quivi-essential-kit.svg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"/></div><div class=\"marquee-pill\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><p>One complimentary QuiviTech Essential Kit with builds below RM10,000.</p><img class=\"marquee-icon\" src=\"/quivi-essential-kit.svg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"/></div><div class=\"marquee-pill\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><p>One complimentary QuiviTech Essential Kit with builds below RM10,000.</p><img class=\"marquee-icon\" src=\"/quivi-essential-kit.svg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"/></div></div></div></aside><section class=\"section site-cta-section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"quote-band site-cta\" data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"site-cta-copy\"><h2 class=\"headline\">Ready to plan your build?</h2><p>Tell us what you want your PC to do and what you want to spend.</p></div><a class=\"round-btn\" href=\"/contact#quote-request\">Request a Quote <span data-icon=\"ArrowUpRight\"></span></a></div></div></section>\n</main>"
  },
  "/quivicraft/details": {
    "name": "Craft Details",
    "title": "QuiviCraft Custom PC Builds | QuiviTech Malaysia",
    "description": "Custom gaming and workstation PC building in Malaysia. Explore QuiviTech component selection, PC assembly, cooling and build process.",
    "html": "<main class=\"site-main\" id=\"main\"><section class=\"page-hero\" style=\"--section-color:#CD9558\"><div class=\"container\"><span class=\"kicker\">QUIVICRAFT / CUSTOM PC BUILDS</span><h1 class=\"headline h1\">The Dream.<br/>Built precisely.</h1><p>A custom PC built for your games, workflow and style—with clear component advice and careful attention to every detail.</p><a class=\"hero-scroll-arrow\" href=\"#page-content\" aria-label=\"Scroll to the next section\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></a></div></section><section id=\"page-content\" class=\"section\"><div class=\"container split\"><div data-reveal=\"\"><span class=\"kicker\">CUSTOM PC BUILDS</span><h2 class=\"headline h2\">Built around you.</h2><p>Choose a custom desktop for gaming, content creation or everyday productivity. We help balance performance, cooling, aesthetics and your budget.</p><a class=\"round-btn\" href=\"/contact\">Get a build quote <span data-icon=\"ArrowUpRight\"></span></a></div><div class=\"photobox\"><img alt=\"Custom gaming PC interior\" data-parallax=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/gaming-pc-interior.jpg\"/></div></div></section><section class=\"section soft\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-head\" data-reveal=\"\"><div><span class=\"kicker\">OUR PROCESS</span><h2 class=\"headline h2\">Simple from start to finish.</h2></div></div><div class=\"journey-row\" data-stagger=\"\"><div class=\"journey-step\" style=\"color:#070A0A;border-color:#dedbd8\"><span class=\"n\" style=\"color:#805A51\">01</span><h3>Discover</h3><p style=\"color:#555\">Tell us what you need.</p></div><div class=\"journey-step\" style=\"color:#070A0A;border-color:#dedbd8\"><span class=\"n\" style=\"color:#805A51\">02</span><h3>Configure</h3><p style=\"color:#555\">Choose the right components.</p></div><div class=\"journey-step\" style=\"color:#070A0A;border-color:#dedbd8\"><span class=\"n\" style=\"color:#805A51\">03</span><h3>Assemble</h3><p style=\"color:#555\">Built and checked carefully.</p></div><div class=\"journey-step\" style=\"color:#070A0A;border-color:#dedbd8\"><span class=\"n\" style=\"color:#805A51\">04</span><h3>Handover</h3><p style=\"color:#555\">Understand your new system.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-head\" data-reveal=\"\"><div><span class=\"kicker\">BUILD SHOWCASE</span><h2 class=\"headline h2\">See the build.</h2></div></div><div class=\"gallery build-showcase-gallery\" data-reveal=\"\"><a href=\"/build-showcase.jpg\"><img alt=\"PC gaming build\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/build-showcase.jpg\"/></a><a href=\"/pc-components.jpg\"><img alt=\"PC components\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/pc-components.jpg\"/></a><a href=\"/gaming-desk.jpg\"><img alt=\"Gaming desk arrangement\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/gaming-desk.jpg\"/></a><a href=\"/pc-motherboard.jpg\"><img alt=\"PC motherboard\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/pc-motherboard.jpg\"/></a><a href=\"/pc-maintenance.jpg\"><img alt=\"Computer servicing\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/pc-maintenance.jpg\"/></a></div><dialog class=\"build-photo-viewer\" aria-label=\"Build Showcase photo gallery\"><div class=\"swiper\"><div class=\"swiper-wrapper\"></div></div><div class=\"build-photo-toolbar\"><div class=\"review-controls\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"build-photo-prev\" aria-label=\"Previous photo\"><span data-icon=\"ArrowLeft\"></span></button><span class=\"build-photo-count\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span><button type=\"button\" class=\"build-photo-next\" aria-label=\"Next photo\"><span data-icon=\"ArrowRight\"></span></button></div><form method=\"dialog\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"round-btn outline\" autofocus=\"\">Close photo</button></form></div></dialog></div></section><section class=\"section site-cta-section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"quote-band site-cta\" data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"site-cta-copy\"><h2 class=\"headline\">The Dream. Made Real.</h2><p>Tell us your budget, needs and ideal setup.</p></div><a class=\"round-btn\" href=\"/contact\">Contact Us <span data-icon=\"ArrowUpRight\"></span></a></div></div></section></main>"
