  "/quivicraft/serve": {
    "name": "QuiviServe",
    "title": "QuiviServe PC Service Memberships | QuiviTech Malaysia",
    "description": "Learn about QuiviServe PC maintenance and support memberships with proposed 1-year, 2-year and 5-year service tiers.",
    "html": "<main class=\"site-main\" id=\"main\"><section class=\"page-hero\" style=\"--section-color:#A7D7FF\"><div class=\"container\"><span class=\"kicker\">QUIVISERVE / MEMBERSHIPS</span><h1 class=\"headline h1\">Support that<br/>stays with you.</h1><p>Maintenance and support memberships for more confidence beyond your PC handover.</p><a class=\"hero-scroll-arrow\" href=\"#page-content\" aria-label=\"Scroll to the next section\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></a></div></section><section id=\"page-content\" class=\"section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-head\" data-reveal=\"\"><div><span class=\"kicker\">QUIVISERVE MEMBERSHIP</span><h2 class=\"headline h2\">Choose your level.</h2></div><p>Proposed membership tiers. Prices, eligibility, schedules and final inclusions require QuiviTech confirmation.</p></div><div class=\"tiers\" data-stagger=\"\"><article class=\"tier\"><span class=\"overline\">01 / ESSENTIAL</span><div class=\"metal\"><span>STANDARD</span></div><h3>1 Year</h3><p>Everyday technical support.</p><ul><li>Standard technical support</li><li>Periodic maintenance service</li></ul><a class=\"round-btn\" href=\"/contact\">Enquire <span data-icon=\"ArrowUpRight\"></span></a></article><article class=\"tier\"><span class=\"overline\">02 / PREFERRED</span><div class=\"metal\"><span>PRIORITY</span></div><h3>2 Years</h3><p>Care with added convenience.</p><ul><li>Priority support</li><li>Free system health checks</li><li>Eligible component discounts</li></ul><a class=\"round-btn\" href=\"/contact\">Enquire <span data-icon=\"ArrowUpRight\"></span></a></article><article class=\"tier premium\"><span class=\"overline\">03 / SIGNATURE</span><div class=\"metal\"><span>PREMIUM</span></div><h3>5 Years</h3><p>A more personal experience.</p><ul><li>VIP support status</li><li>Periodic full cleaning</li><li>Dedicated support contact line</li></ul><a class=\"round-btn\" href=\"/contact\">Enquire <span data-icon=\"ArrowUpRight\"></span></a></article></div><p class=\"caption-note\">All tiers are draft service concepts; terms, availability, warranty interplay and fees must be approved before launch.</p></div></section><section class=\"section site-cta-section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"quote-band site-cta\" data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"site-cta-copy\"><h2 class=\"headline\">The Dream. Made Real.</h2><p>Tell us your budget, needs and ideal setup.</p></div><a class=\"round-btn\" href=\"/contact\">Contact Us <span data-icon=\"ArrowUpRight\"></span></a></div></div></section></main>"
