  "/quivicraft/care": {
    "name": "QuiviCare",
    "title": "QuiviCare PC Warranty Explained | QuiviTech Malaysia",
    "description": "Understand QuiviCare PC component warranty information for CPU, GPU, motherboard, RAM, storage, power supply, cooling and case.",
    "html": "<main class=\"site-main\" id=\"main\"><section class=\"page-hero\" style=\"--section-color:#5AC7B7\"><div class=\"container\"><span class=\"kicker\">QUIVICARE / COMPONENT WARRANTY</span><h1 class=\"headline h1\">Clear coverage.<br/>Less guesswork.</h1><p>Know what each PC component is, what to check, and where to find the applicable warranty terms.</p><a class=\"hero-scroll-arrow\" href=\"#page-content\" aria-label=\"Scroll to the next section\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></a></div></section><section id=\"page-content\" class=\"section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-head\" data-reveal=\"\"><div><span class=\"kicker\">8 COMPONENT CATEGORIES</span><h2 class=\"headline h2\">Every part counts.</h2></div><p>Actual coverage differs by component model, manufacturer, supplier and order. Written warranty documents always govern.</p></div><div class=\"component-grid\" data-stagger=\"\"><article class=\"component\"><div class=\"symbol\">▣</div><h3>CPU / Processor</h3><p>Confirm manufacturer terms</p></article><article class=\"component\"><div class=\"symbol\">▧</div><h3>GPU / Graphics</h3><p>Confirm manufacturer terms</p></article><article class=\"component\"><div class=\"symbol\">▤</div><h3>Motherboard</h3><p>Confirm manufacturer terms</p></article><article class=\"component\"><div class=\"symbol\">▥</div><h3>Memory / RAM</h3><p>Confirm manufacturer terms</p></article><article class=\"component\"><div class=\"symbol\">▦</div><h3>Storage / SSD</h3><p>Confirm manufacturer terms</p></article><article class=\"component\"><div class=\"symbol\">◉</div><h3>Power Supply</h3><p>Confirm manufacturer terms</p></article><article class=\"component\"><div class=\"symbol\">❄</div><h3>Cooling System</h3><p>Confirm manufacturer terms</p></article><article class=\"component\"><div class=\"symbol\">⌘</div><h3>Case &amp; Fans</h3><p>Confirm manufacturer terms</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section soft\"><div class=\"container split\"><div class=\"photobox\"><img alt=\"Close-up of desktop motherboard\" data-parallax=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/pc-motherboard.jpg\"/></div><div data-reveal=\"\"><span class=\"kicker\">100% CLEAR INFORMATION</span><h2 class=\"headline h2\">No guessing.<br/>Just clarity.</h2><p>We recommend supplying the exact parts list, warranty durations, exclusions and claims procedure before confirming a build. No universal warranty period is implied.</p><a class=\"round-btn\" href=\"/contact\">Ask about coverage <span data-icon=\"ArrowUpRight\"></span></a></div></div></section><section class=\"section site-cta-section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"quote-band site-cta\" data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"site-cta-copy\"><h2 class=\"headline\">The Dream. Made Real.</h2><p>Tell us your budget, needs and ideal setup.</p></div><a class=\"round-btn\" href=\"/contact\">Contact Us <span data-icon=\"ArrowUpRight\"></span></a></div></div></section></main>"
  },
