    "title": "QuiviPlus PC Upgrades and Maintenance | QuiviTech Malaysia",
    "description": "QuiviPlus offers PC hardware upgrades, diagnostic support, cleaning and desktop maintenance services in Malaysia. Request a case-by-case quote.",
    "html": "<main class=\"site-main\" id=\"main\"><section class=\"page-hero\"><div class=\"container\"><span class=\"kicker\">QUIVI PLUS / PC SERVICES</span><h1 class=\"headline h1\">Better performance.<br/>Less hassle.</h1><p>PC upgrades, computer maintenance and diagnostics designed to extend the life of your setup.</p><a class=\"hero-scroll-arrow\" href=\"#page-content\" aria-label=\"Scroll to the next section\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></a></div></section><section id=\"page-content\" class=\"section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-head\" data-reveal=\"\"><div><span class=\"kicker\">UPGRADE / MAINTAIN / RESTORE</span><h2 class=\"headline h2\">Keep your PC in its prime.</h2></div></div><div class=\"cards three\" data-stagger=\"\"><article class=\"editorial-card\"><div class=\"card-photo\"><img alt=\"Hardware Upgrades\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/pc-components.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"card-content\"><span class=\"chip plus\">01 / UPGRADE</span><h3>Hardware Upgrades</h3><p>Better graphics, more storage, memory and cooling—based on compatibility.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/contact\">Explore <span data-icon=\"ArrowUpRight\"></span></a></div></article><article class=\"editorial-card\"><div class=\"card-photo\"><img alt=\"PC Cleaning\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/pc-cleaning.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"card-content\"><span class=\"chip plus\">02 / MAINTENANCE</span><h3>PC Cleaning</h3><p>Cleaning and preventive maintenance for a more dependable system.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/contact\">Explore <span data-icon=\"ArrowUpRight\"></span></a></div></article><article class=\"editorial-card\"><div class=\"card-photo\"><img alt=\"Diagnostics\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/pc-motherboard.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"card-content\"><span class=\"chip plus\">03 / SUPPORT</span><h3>Diagnostics</h3><p>Troubleshoot slow performance, instability or unexpected hardware issues.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/contact\">Explore <span data-icon=\"ArrowUpRight\"></span></a></div></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section soft\"><div class=\"container split\"><div class=\"photobox\"><img alt=\"PC servicing workbench\" data-parallax=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/pc-maintenance.jpg\"/></div><div data-reveal=\"\"><span class=\"kicker\">SERVICE QUOTES</span><h2 class=\"headline h2\">No surprise work.</h2><p>Tell us the issue. After assessment, we explain the recommended work and provide case-by-case pricing before you approve the service.</p><a class=\"round-btn\" href=\"/contact\">Request a service quote <span data-icon=\"ArrowUpRight\"></span></a></div></div></section><section class=\"section site-cta-section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"quote-band site-cta\" data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"site-cta-copy\"><h2 class=\"headline\">The Dream. Made Real.</h2><p>Tell us your budget, needs and ideal setup.</p></div><a class=\"round-btn\" href=\"/contact\">Contact Us <span data-icon=\"ArrowUpRight\"></span></a></div></div></section></main>"
